<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00503/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个评分栏，任何看到这个评分栏的人都会不受控制的给予差评。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/12/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><em>位于Site-CN-██的绩效考核表上。</em></span> 基金会内部网站<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><em>被愤怒的CreepSheep博士人道主义毁灭</em></span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">已损毁</span> 已在基金会内部网站上再次出现。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><br />
<span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><em>这个傻█玩意毁了我的年终奖啊啊啊啊啊</em></span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">——濒临崩溃的CreepSheep博士</span><br />
<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">节哀顺变。 &#8212;——Dr.baboon</span><br />
这<em>TM</em>到底是个什么玩意？给爷爬啊啊啊 ——Dr.CreepSheep</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00503" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00503" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00503-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/creep-sheep" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6999615); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6999615&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609447035" alt="Creep Sheep" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6999615)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/creep-sheep" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6999615); return false;">Creep Sheep</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1609313767 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">30 Dec 2020 07:36</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00224/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张铁架床，当有人躺在项目上并且闭上眼睛时，此人将持续听见“嗡嗡”声当对象睁眼时异常性质消失<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的卧室中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于低价值异常物品收容室<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>哪里有蚊子啊啊啊啊！搞得我一宿没睡觉啊啊啊啊！</em>——在卧室中喷了一整瓶花露水的Dr.pigeon</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00224" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00224" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
